    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/617f6335350e804c9717dcdb2f9c6633.poster.avif?t=1732332416\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/617f6335350e804c9717dcdb2f9c6633.webm?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/617f6335350e804c9717dcdb2f9c6633.mp4?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An All-new Adventure From Kastelo Games!</h2>Play as a brave little robot in a Retro 3D Collectathon! Solve room-sized physics puzzles, blast villains with your laser, and help your fellow workers rise against your tyrannical BOSS. The more bots you break, the easier each puzzle gets!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/3f70d268118b73e6660d99f83132f09d.poster.avif?t=1732332416\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/3f70d268118b73e6660d99f83132f09d.webm?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/3f70d268118b73e6660d99f83132f09d.mp4?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Nostalgic 3D Art Style</h2>Inspired by early 3D games such as Mario 64, Banjo Kazooie, and Spyro, the simple gameplay of Bricking Bots takes place in a low-res and low-polygon world. Collect tokens, batteries, gears, and more as you explore a robot factory, vats of acid, an abandoned coal mine, and 13 other unique environments!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/9a3d0afb4012927106854e2cfec801a4.poster.avif?t=1732332416\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/9a3d0afb4012927106854e2cfec801a4.webm?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/9a3d0afb4012927106854e2cfec801a4.mp4?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Working Robots Unite!</h2>Bricking Bots also features workplace organization, unionization, going on strike, and union busting from a fresh new perspective. As Test Subject 99 talks to exploited employees and reads pro-labor pamphlets, they slowly realize that they have rights worth defending!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/617f6335350e804c9717dcdb2f9c6633.poster.avif?t=1732332416\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/617f6335350e804c9717dcdb2f9c6633.webm?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/617f6335350e804c9717dcdb2f9c6633.mp4?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An All-new Adventure From Kastelo Games!</h2>Play as a brave little robot in a Retro 3D Collectathon! Solve room-sized physics puzzles, blast villains with your laser, and help your fellow workers rise against your tyrannical BOSS. The more bots you break, the easier each puzzle gets!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/3f70d268118b73e6660d99f83132f09d.poster.avif?t=1732332416\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/3f70d268118b73e6660d99f83132f09d.webm?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/3f70d268118b73e6660d99f83132f09d.mp4?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Nostalgic 3D Art Style</h2>Inspired by early 3D games such as Mario 64, Banjo Kazooie, and Spyro, the simple gameplay of Bricking Bots takes place in a low-res and low-polygon world. Collect tokens, batteries, gears, and more as you explore a robot factory, vats of acid, an abandoned coal mine, and 13 other unique environments!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/9a3d0afb4012927106854e2cfec801a4.poster.avif?t=1732332416\" width=600 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/9a3d0afb4012927106854e2cfec801a4.webm?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2986580/extras/9a3d0afb4012927106854e2cfec801a4.mp4?t=1732332416\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Working Robots Unite!</h2>Bricking Bots also features workplace organization, unionization, going on strike, and union busting from a fresh new perspective. As Test Subject 99 talks to exploited employees and reads pro-labor pamphlets, they slowly realize that they have rights worth defending!",
